xscreensaver-mystify (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Synchronize Mystify with the implementation prepared for XScreenSaver.
  * Keep the display hack source byte-for-byte identical to the main tree.
  * Add standalone XScreenSaver lifecycle, resource, and color helpers.
  * Build a single xscreensaver-mystify binary package.
  * Correct the installed manual section without modifying the mirrored source.

